msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san? It's me, Shibayama, the guy who asked you to\r\n"
"help collect that loan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Oh, hey. What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "I got a tip Motoyama was seen on Park Boulevard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"I'm heading out there right now. Do you think you could\r\n"
"go there and help look, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Sure, I'll head over to Park Boulevard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Yeah, thanks. I'll give you ten percent as a reward if you\r\n"
"can collect that loan."
msgstr ""

